box(t,25,242,'Calculations and assembly','100k NTC, B25/50=4200K; 1% R25 and B tolerance.\nReference ratios: 0.7369 cold / 0.33557 hot; resistors 0.1%.\nDividers fed by SOLAR_VALID, off below UV threshold.\nAt 4V: sensor 20uA at 25C, references 4.29uA; no battery divider current.\nTLV7031S improves offset to +/-8mV; 7mV typical hysteresis.\nTPS3839L30 inhibits below 2.63V solar; release delayed 200ms typical.\nSee temperature-analysis.md for tolerances and startup qualification.')
